--TEST--
a `for` init clause mixing a declaration with an expression is one diagnostic naming the rule — `rule:iteration/for-init-refusals`'s E0124
--FILE--
<?nvs
int $j = 0;
for (int $i = 0, $j = 1; $i < 3; $i = $i + 1) {
    echo $i;
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0124]: a `for` init clause holds one declaration or a list of expressions, not both
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
